window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When faced with love in its most raw and savage form, can it truly conquer all?</p> <p>Dante wasn't looking for a woman. He was content with being a single dad, and slowly but surely taking his place as leader of his club, Devil's Disciples.</p> <p>His life was busy, and he didn't need women complicating things. Fuck them, leave them.</p> <p>Don't catch feelings.</p> <p>But Dante had never met a woman like Rachel.</p> <p>Rachel has a past. One she has worked hard at erasing. With others paying for her crimes, she moved halfway across the world and put it all behind her. Until a chance encounter with Dante seals her fate, binding them both together in a toxic, violent embrace of passion.</p> <p>As the two strike up a relationship that is as fiery as it is all-consuming, she begins to unravel, revealing wounds that time has failed to heal, igniting a protective fury within Dante.</p> <p>But in a world where loyalty is currency, and strength is power, betrayal strikes, threatening to destroy the very foundation of the Devil's Disciples. Dante is bound by his loyalty, and Rachel soon learns that the biggest danger may not be the secrets she hides, but the man riding at her side.</p>"; 
